<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAB" style="id">- Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Hab</para>
  <para style="toc2">Habakuki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Habakuki</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Habakuki</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chino ni chitabu cha uwoni wa Habakuki. Chitabu cha Habakuki chesimana ne ivitabu vilozize vyo uwoni kwaviya hachina ulosi ukuilanga kwachausa cha Izulaeli hegu Yuda. Ukaleka ayo china mafuzumo maidi na malombezo ya Habakuki. Iviya Chohile ahaitula amafuzumo ya Habakuki. Wasomile wafanyanya kugamba Habakuki akelaga mwe chipindi chimwenga na Yelemiya ne chipindi cho ulongozi wa seuta Yosia na seuta Yehoyakimu. Sicho chitabu cha Habakuki hegu chitabu chituhu chochose cha chibiblia chilongile ichipindi umo Habakuki akalaga. Nkongo Habakuki kafuzuma kwa Chohile kugamba kawona izingavungavu na unaykwili, mna hayahitule amalombezo ya Habakuki yo kulombeza wambizi. Vyadahika Habakuki awonaga izimbuli zino zikatendeka mwe isi ya Yuda. Chohile ahitulaga kwa kugamba, nawenula awantu wa Babeli wawakome awantu wa Yuda. Vikaheza Habakuki kafuzuma kugamba Chohile nendile akajeseza wantu wavu kuwakantila wantu sawo wavu vitendese. Chohile niyo ahitula kwa kugamba hata Wababeli nawakantilwe na kuhutwa nyumani. Mo udumo, Habakuki amlombeza Chohile adamanye na kulagisa mbazi. Amtogola Chohile kwa mbuli nkulu adamanya aho nkongo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1:1-4 ina mafuzumo ya nkongo ya Habakuki.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Mwe isula ya 1:5-11, chasoma hitulo dya nkongo dya Chohile.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Mwe isula ya 1:12-2:1 yatambalisa mwa amafuzumo ya kaidi ya Habakuki.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Mwe sula ya 2:2-20 ina mahitulo ya kaidi ya Chohile. 5. Mwe sula ya 3 yalonga amalombezo ya Habakuki kwa Chohile.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAB 1" />
  <para style="s">Fuzumo dya Habakuki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 1:1" />Uno ni ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile amgubwile muwoni Habakuki. <verse eid="HAB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 1:2" />Weye Zumbe Chohile nahwilile kubula ini, vileke unitegeleze na kunambiza? Kwambwani naila, chadamanyizwa mbuli zihiye, mna weye hukuchikombola? <verse eid="HAB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 1:3" />Ni mbwani wanitenda niwone mbuli zihiye na nkunto? Ubanasi na masulumizo vyanizunguluka, nkumbizi na kuhigana vyalaila chila hantu. <verse eid="HAB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 1:4" />Elo, isigilizi ibelwa, na uwagila haukudamanywa. Wantu wavu wawazunguluka wantu wakanuni, elo uwagila wagonjezwa.<verse eid="HAB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chohile ahitula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 1:5" />Zumbe Chohile niyo awagamba awantu wakwe, “Wakaule awantu mwe izisi ntuhu uwone, nawehelwe na kukangawala. Kwaviya nanuse chisimo ukatenda uchei mjima, chintu icho hata ukagambilwa hozumile. <verse eid="HAB 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 1:6" />Kwaviya nawasinga maya awantu wa Babeli wawebungeni, isi idya ya awantu wakali na wakogofya. Wantu awo wazunguluka mwe si yose chani wahude isanga ya wantu watuhu. <verse eid="HAB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 1:7" />Wantu awo watisa na kogofya, awo hawakutimila sigilizi yoyose ukaleka iyawo wenye, chiya wakunga nicho wakudamanya.” <verse eid="HAB 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 1:8" />“Izifalasi zawo zasunguzisa kuguluka kujinka sui, ni nkali kujinka mauzi yana sala. Wakwela falasi wawo walawa hale, wahuha mo kwebunga awankondo wawo nisaviya mpungu ikugwila maingo.” <verse eid="HAB 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 1:9" />“Wagomba nkondo wose weza wadamanye unyakwili, izinyuso zawo zatisa wajendeleza kulongozi enga msanga ukulawa kwedijangwa, wachisanya wantu watahigwe enga msanga wa mpwani. <verse eid="HAB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 1:10" />Wawatila maseuta, na kuwabela vilongozi. Chila ngome wawona nutilizi, waichisanyiza msanga wakwela na kuitaha imizi yawo. <verse eid="HAB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 1:11" />Wakaheza wahinga kulongozi saviya mpeho, wadamanya ubanasi na kutenda na mlema, kwaviya wafanyanya kugamba mnungu ywawo nuyo akuwenka izinguvu.”<verse eid="HAB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habakuki afuzuma vituhu kwa Zumbe Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 1:12" />Weye gamba ni weye Zumbe Chohile kukongela chikale? Ni weye Chohile Mkuka ywangu hwikubanika. Zumbe Chohile kuwasagula Wakalidayo wachikantile. Weye mwamizi ywangu, kuwadindimaza vileke wachebunge. <verse eid="HAB 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 1:13" />Weye wi mkuka vitendese, hukudaha kusinya wavu, hukudaha kujijimiza kuwona wihi. Elo, kwabwani wawona wakudamanya wavu mna weye wanyamala? Ni bwani wanyamala dwii umo wantu wavu wakawabinda wantu wakanuni kujinka wowo? <verse eid="HAB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 1:14" />Wantu kuwatenda enga samaki mwe ibahali, saviya vyumbe wakutambala hewene chilongozi. <verse eid="HAB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 1:15" />Wababeli walowa wantu saviya walowa samaki kwa ndwana, wawakweseza kuse kwa lwavu na kuzichisanyiza mwe migono yawo wakaheza welelwa na kuvina. <verse eid="HAB 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 1:16" />Elo, wavikila izinyavu zawo na kuzivunkiziza ubani, kwaviya kwachausa che izinyavu izo ziwadahiza kutenda wagoli na kudya nkande za yombe kulu. <verse eid="HAB 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 1:17" />Togola nojendeleze kugomba nkondo mazuwa yose na kukoma wantu mwe izisi hehena mbazi?<verse eid="HAB 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAB 2" />
  <para style="s">Chohile amhitula Habakuki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 2:1" />Miye nanichimale hantu hokugojeza mwe lingo, nanikaule chani niwone idyo nanigambile ne ivyo hunga nihitule mwe imbuli yo kufuzuma kwangu. <verse eid="HAB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 2:2" />Vikaheza Zumbe Chohile niyo anihitula vino, “Yawandike yano hunga hugubwile mlanga mwe vibawo, chani chila akujinka aho adahe kuyasoma kwa uhufu. <verse eid="HAB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 2:3" />Yawandike yano hukulagisa kwaviya chipindi chakwe cho kulaila hachinati, mna ni chindedi nayasunguze kwiza mwa mazuwa yo udumo. Uneva yawonekana yakawa ugoje, chindedi naubule, naho haukawe. <verse eid="HAB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 2:4" />Wakaule wata kweduvya, awo nawakomwe, mna wakanuni nawekale kwa kumzumila Chohile.”<verse eid="HAB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wavu nawakomwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 2:5" />Chindedi divai yadantiliza, mntu mta kweduvya hakwikala kwakwe na kuhema. Kemalanya awamele awamwenga saviya bome hedine uhelo, enga file haikwiguswa ni chintu chochose. Echisanyiza wantu mwe izisi na kuwatenda enga ni wakwe. <verse eid="HAB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 2:6" />Chila mntu namtile mntu sauyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:6">na kumtungila nchemo zo utilizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:6">“Noluwone weye ukwechisanyiza sivyo vyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:6">na kukopa vintu vya wantu ukaheza hukuliha!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 2:6">Nojendeleze kudamanya ivyo kubula ini?”<verse eid="HAB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 2:7" />Togola wadya wakukutigiza hawakwinukile chalumwe zuwa dimwenga. Togola hawakwinukile na kukogofya? Aho nawakutahe na kukutenda mtumwa ywawo.<verse eid="HAB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 2:8" />Weye kupolaganya vintu mwe si zilozize, mna wose nawachulupuke nawakupolaganye weye, kwa ukomi na kubunyanya uwatendele wantu mwe isi, heye viya utndile mwe mizi na awekazi wakwe wose. <verse eid="HAB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 2:9" />Noluwone weye ukwechisanyiza ugoli kwa kubunyanya watuhu, uzenge nyumba yako kulanga ko lugulu, ukafanyanya kugamba nawikale mpeho, ukaleka kubanikilwa. <verse eid="HAB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 2:10" />Mna kwa mizungu yako yo ukomi kuwajela soni wantu we ikaya yako. Kwa kukoma wantu walozize mwe izisi, weye mwenye nokomwe. <verse eid="HAB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 2:11" />Nivyo vikuleka hata mayuwe nayafuzume mwe ichiwambaza, ne imisomo ye inyumba nayo nailavye mwangwi. <verse eid="HAB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 2:12" />Noluwone weye ukuzenga kaya kwa kukoma wantu, ukwetogezeza mzi kwa ukomi. <verse eid="HAB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 2:13" />Togola, Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu zose ahosa kuhikiliza kwa wantu kwagile komoto, na awantu mwe isi wetumbwadisa vya bule? <verse eid="HAB 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 2:14" />Kwaviya isi naimeme wantu wamanyize ukulu wa Zumbe Chohile saviya mazi yakwenela mwe ibahali. <verse eid="HAB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 2:15" />Noluwone weye ukuwenka mpombe weyawo, na kujela sumu mwe divai yawo vileke uwone umwazi wawo. <verse eid="HAB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 2:16" />Nomeme soni na wantu hawakutunye. Noinywe weye mwenye na kusebeduka. Zumbe Chohile mwenye nakukoze, ntunyo yako naigubikwe ni soni. <verse eid="HAB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 2:17" />Wavu uwadamanyize awantu wa Lebanoni naukwebunge weye mwenye, ntendwa zako zo kukoma awanyama nazikutise. Vyose ivyo navikubwile weye, kwa ukomi na kubunyanya uwatendele wantu mwe isi, udamanye mwe imizi na awekazi wakwe wose. <verse eid="HAB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 2:18" />Tukulu disongolwe ni mntu dyambiza chibwani? Tukulu didamanywe kwa chumbu chilujulwe, ni chintu chikuhinya udanti. Mdamanya matukulu aika msuhi wakwe mwe chintu adamanye mwenye, idyo ni tukulu hedikudaha hata kulonga! <verse eid="HAB 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 2:19" />Naluwone yudya akuugamba mti, “Inuka!” Akudigamba yuwe hedikudaha kulonga, “Chimala!” Togola tukulu dyadaha kumhinya mntu? Kaula dihakwa zahabu na chumbu mna hadina ujima wowose. <verse eid="HAB 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAB 2:20" />Mna Zumbe Chohile emndani mwe Inyumba yakwe ikukile, awantu mwe isi yose wanyamale dwii kulongozi kwakwe.<verse eid="HAB 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HAB 3" />
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya Habakuki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 3:1" />Muoni Habakuki kalombeza vino,<verse eid="HAB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 3:2" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, izimbuli zako ne izintendwa zako siziva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">miye nogoha kwa viya udamanye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">Damanya naho izimbuli izo mwe imihilimo yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">zidamanye vileke zimanyike mwe chino ichipindi chetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">Umo ukeihiwa hampu chiwonele mbazi.<verse eid="HAB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 3:3" />Chohile keza kulawa komzi wa Temani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:3">Chohile mkuka kulawa ko ulugulu lwa Palani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:3">Ung'azi wakwe ugubika kwembingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:3">na awantu wose mwe isi wamtogola uyo.<verse eid="HAB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 3:4" />Mmweko wakwe wenga wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:4">myale ilawa mwe imikono yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:4">umo zili izinguvu zakwe.<verse eid="HAB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 3:5" />Kegala unyonje wihiye umlongoila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:5">kunyuma atimilwa ni nkomano.<verse eid="HAB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 3:6" />Anachimala isi yasingisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">anawasinya awantu mwe izisi awo wemwe isi wazingiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">Magulu ya chikale yatulwatulwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">wagulu wa kale watulikatulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">sila zakwe ni za kale na kale.<verse eid="HAB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 3:7" />Siwawona awantu wa Kushani wangadika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:7">na awantu wa Midiani wazingiza.<verse eid="HAB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 3:8" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, togola kuihiwa imito?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:8">Togola kuweihiwa awamto?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:8">Togola kuyeihiwa amazi mwe ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:8">vikuleka kwendesha izifalasi zako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:8">na amalingishe ye nkondo upate uhuda?<verse eid="HAB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 3:9" />Uta wako kuumalanya kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:9">imifulo kuika mwe ngole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:9">Mito kuitenda igubule isanga.<verse eid="HAB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 3:10" />Amagulu yeze yakuwone niyo yogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:10">mabohwelo niyo yajinkila umo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:10">Mazi niyo yetika kulawa kulanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:10">Mizumilizo ye ibahali niyo yavumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:10">na kupilisa kulanga amawimbi yakwe.<verse eid="HAB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 3:11" />Zuwa no umnenge niyo vyanyamala dwii ko ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:11">ize iwone ung'azi we imifulo yako ikuntigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:11">ize iwone ung'azi we idiguha dyago dikumweka.<verse eid="HAB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 3:12" />Kujinka mlanga mwe isi kwa maya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:12">Mo ukwihiwa kwako kuwajata awantu mwe isi yose.<verse eid="HAB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 3:13" />Niyo wafosa waita wakuwambula wantu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:13">na kumwambula yudya usagule kwa kumjela mavuta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:13">Kumhonda chilongozi ywe ikaya ya wantu wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:13">niyo wawabinda pele awantu nakajesanya nawo.<verse eid="HAB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 3:14" />Sekulu ywa awagomba nkondo wawo kumlasa mifulo yawo wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:14">kuwatunga mwe imitwi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:14">umo idibunga dya wagomba nkondo wachibasize enga luzimu chani wachisambalagase,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:14">wakeduvya kuwakoma wachiwa mudya wefisize.<verse eid="HAB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 3:15" />Kujinka mwe ibahali ne izifalasi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:15">bahali ikujubwaniswa ni mawimbi.<verse eid="HAB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 3:16" />Nize nive izimbuli izo niyo netuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">milomo yangu izingiza kwa nkama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">amavuha yangu yatenkuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">iviga vyangu vidunduga kujenda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">Natongomala nagoja idizuwa idyo dye nkomano dikuwezila wadya wakuchebunga.<verse eid="HAB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 3:17" />Hata hegu imiti ye mitini haina bwalike maluwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">hegu mizabibu hayeleke zabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">mizaituni haineleke zaituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">na izinkonde hazina lavize ulozo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">hata izingoto zinafa mwe ididewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">ne izing'ombe zinosika mwa amadewa,<verse eid="HAB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 3:18" />miye nanijendeleze kumbweda Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:18">hata ivyo namwelelwa Zumbe Chohile mwambula ywangu.<verse eid="HAB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 3:19" />Zumbe, Zumbe Chohile nuyo akunidahiza kutenda na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:19">adindimaza iviga vyanvgu enga vya kapala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:19">anidahiza kujenda mpeho mlanga mwa amagulu.<verse eid="HAB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 3" />
</usx>